Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:04.73,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Zoti Colt, jam kaq e nderuar\Nt'ju kem këtu sot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:06.74,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Nuk ishte gjë, vërtet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:12.11,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Të dhënia e një magazine si kjo\Nnë territorin e Shtëpisë Lampton
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:15.79,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,i dha Firma Tregtare Elizabeth\Nnjë shpërthim entuziazmi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:17.24,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Jam kaq e lumtur ta dëgjoj.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.99,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Tani, nëse mund të diskutojmë—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:22.61,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Para kësaj, ka dikë\Nqë dua t'ju prezantoj.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:24.48,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Mua?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.62,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Hyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:31.27,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Z-Zoti Belit! Çfarë po bëni këtu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:34.18,Default,Belit,0,0,0,,Ka kaluar kohë, Zoti Maverick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:40.01,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Ai më tha se po komplotonit\Npër t'i ngritur një kurth Funnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.40,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Unë? Një kurth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.11,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Çfarë marrëzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:47.34,Default,Barl,0,0,0,,Lëre aktrimin. Ne dimë gjithçka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:49.66,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Me siguri ka pasur\Nndonjë keqkuptim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.82,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Sot do t'ju prezantoja\Nme pronarin tonë...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:55.17,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Pronarin tuaj...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:57.54,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Ellie Leis e Firmës Tregtare\NTraitre, apo jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.86,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,S-Si e dinit—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.75,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,E dimë se mbështetësi juaj është një\Ntregtar nga një kompani perandorake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.89,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Tani, silleni këtu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.74,Default,Barl,0,0,0,,Je i sigurt për këtë?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.93,Default,Barl,0,0,0,,Ndoshta do të sjellë roje.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:17.21,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Atëherë do t'i kapim në një luftë.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:20.98,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Kemi sjellë njëqind\Nroje tona.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:24.71,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Ata ndoshta tashmë\Ni kanë zhdukur njerëzit e tyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:31.35,Default,Colt,0,0,0,,Ja ku jemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.61,Default,Ellie,0,0,0,,Më falni.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:40.24,Default,Ellie,0,0,0,,Unë jam pronarja e Firmës\NTregtare Elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:43.49,Default,Ellie,0,0,0,,Ellie Leis.
